{
  "id": "e542197a-5652-42bd-a4b1-9ebf15eee194",
  "page_title": "Monitoring Azure OpenAI Service",
  "page_description": "Learn how to use Azure Monitor tools like Log Analytics to capture and analyze metrics and data logs for your Azure OpenAI Service resources.",
  "page_date": "07/12/2024",
  "chunk_title": "Dashboards",
  "chunk_content": "Dashboards  Azure OpenAI provides out-of-box dashboards for each of your Azure OpenAI resources. To access the monitoring dashboards sign-in to https://portal.azure.com and select the overview pane for one of your Azure OpenAI resources.  :::image type=\"content\" source=\"../media/monitoring/dashboard.png\" alt-text=\"Screenshot that shows out-of-box dashboards for an Azure OpenAI resource in the Azure portal.\" lightbox=\"../media/monitoring/dashboard.png\" border=\"false\":::  The dashboards are grouped into four categories: HTTP Requests, Tokens-Based Usage, PTU Utilization, and Fine-tuning",
